<title>USA: Vivra Inc earned $4.5 million in July.</title>
<headline>Vivra Inc earned $4.5 million in July.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vivra Inc said it earned $4.5 million on revenues of $45.6 million for the month ended July 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The unaudited consolidated financial results include the operations of two dialysis centers acquired effective June 1, 1996, in an exchange of stock and accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>This one-month report has been issued to comply with the Securities and Exchange Commission requirements to publish a minimum of 30 days  of combined post-merger operating results.</p>
</text>
